## 📊 Typical Timeline (4-Week Project)

| Week | Phase | Key Activities | Deliverables |
|------|-------|---------------|--------------|
| **Week 1** | Discover + Define | Requirements, charter, mockup | Signed charter, validated data |
| **Week 2** | Develop | Build pipeline, weekly check-in | Working prototype |
| **Week 3** | Develop | Refine analysis, iterate | Draft deliverable |
| **Week 4** | Deliver | Finalize, present, get feedback | Final analysis |
| **Week 5** | Document | Lessons learned, handoff | Documentation |

**Adjust for your project complexity**, but maintain the phase sequence.

