## 🚦 Red Flags to Watch For

Your project may be in trouble if:

🚩 **Day 1 and you're writing code**  
→ STOP. Do discovery first.

🚩 **Week 2 and sponsor hasn't seen anything**  
→ STOP. Schedule check-in today.

🚩 **You've calculated the same metric multiple ways**  
→ STOP. Get clear definition in writing.

🚩 **Numbers don't match published reports**  
→ STOP. Figure out why before proceeding.

🚩 **Building something complex and not sure why**  
→ STOP. Go back to project charter.

🚩 **Stakeholder says "I thought you were building X"**  
→ STOP. Realign expectations immediately.

