## ✅ Success Metrics

Measure your project against these benchmarks:

### **Efficiency:**
- ✅ Deliver within estimated timeline (±20%)
- ✅ Less than 10 hours of rework
- ✅ First draft within 20% of final version

### **Process:**
- ✅ Project charter signed off by Day 3
- ✅ Weekly check-ins starting Week 1
- ✅ Data validated before building analysis

### **Quality:**
- ✅ Zero calculation errors in final deliverable
- ✅ Stakeholder response: "This is exactly what I needed"
- ✅ Code is documented and reusable

### **Outcome:**
- ✅ Analysis drives an actual decision
- ✅ Deliverable gets used (not shelved)
- ✅ Stakeholder requests follow-up work

